      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "The CMake version in Debian Trixie, where the \"macOS-cross *\" jobs run, does not support `CMAKE_LINK_WARNING_AS_ERROR` yet:\n```\n-- Configuring done (8.3s)\nCMake Warning:\n  Manually-specified variables were not used by the project:\n\n    CMAKE_LINK_WARNING_AS_ERROR\n\n\n-- Generating done (0.1s)\n-- Build files have been written to: /home/runner/work/_temp/build_ ₿🧪_\n```\n\nI believe you want to modify the \"macOS native*\" jobs instead, where the linker did emit warnings before bitcoin/bitcoin#35756 was merged.",
